  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gunasekaran vs The Commissioner on 1 March, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan 1 W.P.(Md)No.457 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 01.03.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P.(MD)No.457 of 2024 And W.M.P.(MD)No.488 of 2024 Gunasekaran ... The Commissioner, Food and Safety Department, 5th Floor, 359, Anna Salai, Chennai 6. 2. The District Collector, Trichy District, Trichy. 3. The Designated Officer, Food and Safety Department, Food Safety Wing, Trichy 20. ... Responden Prayer: Writ petition filed under Article 226 of the C of India, to issue a Writ of Mandamus, calling for the records pert to the impugned order made in Na.Ka.No.2602/F.S.D/Trichy/2023, date Nil, issued on 29.11.2023 passed by the 3rd respondent and to quash same and consequently direct the 3rd respondent to remove lock and of the petitioner's grocery shop and permit the petitioner to carry business in the same premises. 3. The Designated Officer, Food and Safety Department, Food Safety Wing, Trichy 20. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis G.R.SWAMINATHAN,J. PMU 01.03.2024 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Gunasekaran vs The Commissioner",
